    {
      "question": "If I return DON!! cards from my field to my DON!! deck at the end of my turn based on this [Activate: Main] effect, can I use the \"When a DON!! card on your field is returned to your DON!! deck,\" effect of another of my cards?",
      "answer": "Yes, you can.",
